          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "This list entry was subject to a Minor Amendment on 5 September 2024 to update the name and reformat the text to current standards SP 81 SE 5/8 ASTON CLINTON GREEN END STREET (north east side) No. 58 (Formerly listed as No. 58 Blenheim Cottage) II Cottage. C17 altered, probably timber framed but now plastered over and painted. Thatched roof, half hipped to South West. gable, central brick chimney. Two-storeys, modern gabled porch in centre, irregular casements, gable end has one three-light casement to each floor. RCHM I p.21. MON 13. Listing NGR: SP8795012472"
